WEBVTT

00:00:00.360 --> 00:00:08.302
Alt text starts from the annotated frame's layers. Each numbered step is a layer named Step, a number, and the label to read aloud.

00:00:09.323 --> 00:00:19.966
Draft alt reads the steps in order and writes the alt text. The subject names the screen and opens the sentence, so the numbers in the text always match the numbers in the image.

00:00:20.946 --> 00:00:24.387
For the workstream selector, the subject says the selector is open.

00:00:25.427 --> 00:00:33.370
Apply saves the draft through set alt, which runs the inventory's checks. Here it already matches the approved text, so nothing changes.
